# deadcode.allow — functions `make deadcode` may report as unreachable from
# cmd/kit without failing. One extended regular expression per line,
# matched against "<package path>.<func>" or "<package path>.<Type>.<method>".
# Lines starting with # are comments.

# The GitHub platform: kept for the review server, which will
# drive the same engine over a pull request.
^github\.com/alphaeron/kit/internal/platform/ghplatform\..+$

# The platform contract suite: called only from each platform's tests.
^github\.com/alphaeron/kit/internal/platform/platformtest\..+$

# Marker methods: the TUI matches them through a type switch on the
# homeTarget interface, which deadcode's call graph does not see.
^github\.com/alphaeron/kit/internal/tui\.[A-Za-z]+\.forHome$
